暇用之乎？楚漢相距，臣進奇謀之士，顧其計誠足以利國家不耳。且盜嫂受金又何足疑乎？」漢王召讓平曰：「先生事魏不中，遂事楚而去，今又從吾遊，信者固多心乎？」平曰：「臣事魏王，魏王不能用臣説，故去事項王。項王不能信人，其所任愛，非諸項即妻之昆弟，雖有奇士不能用，平乃去楚。聞漢王之能用人，故歸大王。臣躶身來，不受金無以爲資。誠臣計畫有可采者，顧大王用之；使無可用者，金具在，請封輸官，得請骸骨。」漢王乃謝，厚賜，拜爲護軍中尉，盡護諸將。諸將乃不敢復言。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"灌嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"嫂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"先前伯婦已被逐；此處婚後勸語／指控的嫂未定是否同一人，亦不以盜嫂引語當已核事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m007-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"魏無知","kind":"person","person_id":"noi_rkl_11c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shi