"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p018","text":"諺曰：「有白頭如新，傾蓋如故。」何則？知與不知也。故昔樊於期逃秦之燕，藉荊軻首以奉丹之事；王奢去齊之魏，臨城自剄以卻齊而存魏。夫王奢、樊於期非新於齊、秦而故於燕、魏也，所以去二國死兩君者，行合於志而慕義無窮也。是以蘇秦不信於天下，而為燕尾生；白圭戰亡六城，為魏取中山。何則？誠有以相知也。蘇秦相燕，燕人惡之於王，王按劍而怒，食以駃騠；白圭顯於中山，中山人惡之魏文侯，文侯投之以夜光之璧。何則？兩主二臣，剖心坼肝相信，豈移於浮辭哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"2r3_3yo_3sa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"e3o_2bk_lhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"王奢","kind":"person","person_id":"bbk_ttr_lc5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"王奢","kind":"person","person_id":"bbk_ttr_lc5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"2r3_3yo_3sa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"兩君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或譬喻保留；燕尾生不直接當作另一具名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"846_l8f_x6q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"尾生","kind":"person","person_id":"l3n_6lt_37x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"白圭","kind":"person","person_id":"i2k_2p5_wtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m018-0144","s